From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Felipe Paiva <felipe.paiva@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 19 Oct 2026 11:07:50 +0400
Subject: [PATCH] tg16-options

Beetle PCE Fast gets its options answered by slot: the scanline window 3
to 242 first, because the core draws lines 0 to 242 when it is not asked
and 243 lines do not fit the 240-line canvas. Then the 352 horizontal
overscan, the RGB palette, the 2-button pad, the Select+Run soft reset
left on, the core's own turbo off, the sprite limit kept and no
overclock. The frameskip key gets auto like every core that declares
one, so only frames slot does not show are skipped. The CD keys are left
alone: no HuCard reaches them.
---
 crates/slot/src/core_options_policy.rs |  16 +++-
 crates/slot/tests/tg16_canvas.rs       |  50 ++++++++++++
 crates/slot/tests/tg16_common/mod.rs   |  39 +++++++++
 crates/slot/tests/tg16_options.rs      | 109 +++++++++++++++++++++++++
 4 files changed, 212 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)
 create mode 100644 crates/slot/tests/tg16_canvas.rs
 create mode 100644 crates/slot/tests/tg16_common/mod.rs
 create mode 100644 crates/slot/tests/tg16_options.rs

